<section class="prose-legal prose-legal-section">
    <h2>What this is</h2>
    <p>
        EggInc.tools is a landing page for a set of Egg, Inc. fan tools built by one person, plus the
        shared sign-in that the tools use and the small deploy agent used to run them. The hub hosts no
        game data of its own; it links to the tools and shows which version each one is running. The
        sign-in is not a general-purpose identity provider and is not offered as a standalone product;
        you encounter it only because it is what one of the tools uses to sign you in. None of it is a
        game client, a cheat, or a service operated by the developer of Egg, Inc. The hosted instance is
        run by an individual, David Cole, not a company.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="prose-legal prose-legal-section">
    <h2>Each tool has its own terms</h2>
    <p>
        Following a link out of this page puts you under that tool's terms and privacy policy. Nothing
        here overrides them.
    </p>
</section>

