        <li>Impersonate another user or forge session credentials.</li>
        <li>Send excessive or abusive load to its login, session, or sponsor-sync endpoints. Automated traffic that degrades the service for others may be blocked.</li>
        <li>Use it to violate Egg, Inc.'s own terms of service or the rules of the game.</li>
        <li>Use it for any unlawful purpose or to distribute malware.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="prose-legal prose-legal-section">
    <h2>Role and perk accuracy</h2>
    <p>
        Your role and supporter status are derived from what Discord, GitHub, and the operator's own
        records report at the time they are checked. A reasonable effort is made to keep them in sync,
        but real-time accuracy is not guaranteed; a role or perk shown by a tool can lag behind a change
        made at the provider.
    </p>
</section>

